From 12059b00130c78d7cf535e964356716d41f069cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:57:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD selected-agent slash commands to execute
 backend-local actions

Selected chat messages that begin with a slash command token need provider-local handling because Codex backend commands such as status should report recorded session state instead of resuming the model with raw slash text. The backend contract exposes default command hooks, the controller detects strict slash command input, and Codex records command replies from local session state while normal slash-like prose still follows the prompt send path.
